摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Live DSH cost estimates from actual token usage & configurable pricing. / 基于真实 Token 用量与可配置价格的 DSH 开销监控插件。","id":"gh:1337525759","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-cost-guard","slug":"chenzhiyong1994/dsh-cost-guard","topics":["cordis","cost-tracking","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","javascript","token-monitoring"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Live DSH cost estimates from actual token usage & configurable pricing. / 基于真实 Token 用量与可配置价格的 DSH 开"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"SH cost estimates from actual token usage & configurable pricing. / 基于真实 Token 用量与可配置价格的 DSH 开销监控插件。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"English · 简体中文 · Project website ↗"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"# dsh-cost-guard"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Know what every DSH task costs while it runs. `dsh-cost-guard` is a local-only Cordis plugin bundle "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"for DeepSeek Harness that turns recorded token usage into a compact cost pill beside the composer, p"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"er-model totals, and editable pricing. Click the pill for the token mix and session total; the dock "},{"id":"p4s4","text":"als, and editable pricing. Click the pill for the token mix and session total; the dock stays quiet."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"It observes execution; it never blocks, reroutes, or changes the agent."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"**Visit the project website →** — explore the cost pill and pricing screenshots, switch between Engl"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ish and Chinese, and copy the installation prompt. Hosted on **GitHub Pages**, with automatic deploy"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ment from `main`. See website maintenance and publishing."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"> [!IMPORTANT]\n> Token counts come from DSH usage events. Currency amounts are local estimates calcu"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"lated from your configured rates, not authoritative billing data. Provider prices can change—always "},{"id":"p7s3","text":"treat the provider invoice as the source of truth."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## See it in action"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### One quiet pill, details on demand"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The composer dock shows a compact `¥` amount for the current or most recent task. Click it for the m"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"odel, input/output/cache tokens, model-call count, rate window, and session total—without opening an"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"other panel or repeating the composer's existing token and cache readings."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Pricing and totals stay under your control"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Edit model rates, add custom models, apply the official peak/off-peak schedule, inspect per-model to"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"tals, and export or import the configuration from **Settings → Cost Guard**."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"> The screenshots were captured from an earlier v4.3 instance and still show the old full-width bar."},{"id":"p13s2","text":" Release `v5.1.0` uses the compact pill and the 2026-10-28 official rates described below; the image"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"s will be refreshed after the next capture."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Why Cost Guard"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- **Actual usage, not prompt-size guessing** — reads `inputTokens`, `outputTokens`, `cacheReadTokens"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"`, and `cacheWriteTokens` from DSH session events, including retried or interrupted attempts.\n- **Li"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"ve and glanceable** — keeps the current task cost beside the composer; click for the token mix and s"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"ession total.\n- **Subagent-aware** — rolls subagent usage into the active root-session turn, priced "},{"id":"p15s5","text":"with the model that actually served each call.\n- **Restart-resilient** — rebuilds a session from its"},{"id":"p15s6","text":" persisted log the first time it is viewed, so history survives plugin restarts.\n- **Pricing you can"},{"id":"p15s7","text":" audit** — all model rates and the peak/off-peak windows are visible and editable.\n- **Bilingual UI*"},{"id":"p15s8","text":"* — the pill and settings page follow the DSH language setting (中文 / English) automatically.\n- **Loc"},{"id":"p15s9","text":"al-only** — no telemetry, external service, account access, or API key collection.\n- **Zero executio"},{"id":"p15s10","text":"n interference** — no prediction gate, approval overlay, or model routing."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Install into your current profile"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"`dsh-cost-guard` is a Cordis **bundle**: `package.json` declares `dsh.bundle.patch` (the Host row) a"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"nd `dsh.client` (the browser half). Install it the way DSH installs any bundle:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"1. Put this repository somewhere stable on disk, for example `D:\\plugins\\dsh-cost-guard`.\n2. Open **"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"Settings → Plugins → Bundles** (插件 → 组合包) in DSH and install from the local directory, or run the CL"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ugins → Bundles** (插件 → 组合包) in DSH and install from the local directory, or run the CLI equivalent:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"3. Restart DSH when the installer reports `restart-required`."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Ask your DSH agent instead, if you prefer:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The plugin then appears as **Cost Guard** in the plugin inventory and as a top-level **Settings → Co"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"st Guard** page, with a compact cost pill below the composer. No build step is required: both halves"},{"id":"p24s3","text":" are plain JavaScript."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"For local development against a checkout, the same command accepts the checkout path directly and li"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"nks it instead of copying it."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### Requirements"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness `0.2.1+` (Desktop or `dsh web`), with a profile that includes the Web app bundle."},{"id":"p27s2","text":"\n- DSH Web UI for the pill and settings panel.\n- Node.js is only needed to run `npm run check` durin"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"for the pill and settings panel.\n- Node.js is only needed to run `npm run check` during development."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Pricing model"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"The `v5.1.0` defaults match the official DeepSeek V4.1 Flash / V4 Pro peak/off-peak pricing verified"},{"id":"p29s2","text":" on **2026-10-28** against the DeepSeek API pricing page and the 2026-09-10 price update. Rates are "},{"id":"p29s3","text":"CNY per 1M tokens, off-peak (valley) prices:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- **Host half** (`index.js`) injects `webServer`, folds durable session events, attributes usage to "},{"id":"p33s2","text":"turns, rolls up subagents, backfills a session from its log on first look, and serves two data route"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"s plus a health probe.\n- **Client half** (`client.js`) is a `window.__ModuleLoader__` bundle that re"},{"id":"p33s4","text":"gisters the cost pill in `conversation.composer.dock` and the configuration UI in `settings.section`"},{"id":"p33s5","text":", and reads the Host through `fetch`.\n- **Data flow** stays inside the running DSH process; the rout"},{"id":"p33s6","text":"es are plain localhost HTTP with no network egress.\n- **Pricing state** is persisted to `~/.dsh/cost"},{"id":"p33s7","text":"-guard/config.json` (`$DSH_HOME` aware), so rates survive restarts."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Security and privacy"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"- No outbound requests, telemetry, credential reads, or API key storage.\n- The Host observes DSH ses"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"sion usage events and replays persisted session events to reconstruct totals.\n- Imported configurati"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"on is validated before it replaces the active settings.\n- Review third-party plugin source before in"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"stalling it, especially because DSH plugin interfaces are still evolving."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"See SECURITY.md for reporting guidance."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"This plugin depends on DSH services and UI slots (`webServer`, `sessions`, `session/event`, `convers"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"ation.composer.dock`, `settings.section`). They are not guaranteed stable APIs. Include your DSH ver"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"sion when reporting compatibility problems."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
